window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Beneath the surface of our world, beyond the veil of ordinary perception, lies the Starseed Academy, a school for souls reincarnated from distant stars. But Synchronicity Jones isn’t like the other students. She arrives with no powers, no memories of past lives, and a shameful secret she can’t escape.</p> <p>While other students heal with light, sound, or spirit animals, Synchronicity can’t even pass her first Energy Work exam. Her peers whisper that she doesn’t belong. Her teachers eye her with either pity or suspicion. And the one person who might understand her, a brooding UFO flight instructor from a long-lost world called Maldek, refuses to let anyone close.</p> <p>But when students begin to vanish and shadows stir at the edges of campus, Synchronicity finds herself drawn into a conspiracy that reaches far beyond the Academy. Whispers of ancient energy vampires resurface. Galactic Federation secrets unravel. And buried within it all lies the real reason Maldek was destroyed in fire and ruin.</p> <p>To stop Earth from meeting the same fate, Synchronicity must awaken the power buried deep within her and embrace the part of herself she’s tried so hard to forget.</p> <p><i>The 999 Portal</i> is not just a story. It is a transmission. A remembrance. A call to those who feel out of place on Earth and yearn for something beyond the veil. Through Synchronicity’s journey, you’ll explore sacred healing techniques, the multidimensional war between light and shadow, and the truth that no soul is ever truly lost.</p>"; 
